{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How long "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" waits before each new attempt at a batch that wasn’t delivered:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"binary exponential backoff, each nominal wait twice the one before, up to a maximum, with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"jitter."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/SQ","doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/SH","doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"HTTPDestinations"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"ExponentialBackoff.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/HTTPDestinations\/ExponentialBackoff.swift#L26"},"externalID":"s:16HTTPDestinations18ExponentialBackoffV","title":"ExponentialBackoff","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ExponentialBackoff","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ExponentialBackoff"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ExponentialBackoff"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ExponentialBackoff()"},{"type":"text","text":" has nominal waits of 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 and 32 seconds, then 60 seconds for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every retry after that, with full jitter, as this one does:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing",